BT /F2 12 Tf 0.06 0.09 0.16 rg 55 718 Td (Root Causes of Slow Buttons & Concrete Performance Solutions) Tj ET
0.88 0.91 0.94 rg
55 710 485 1 re f
BT /F2 9 Tf 0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 55 688 Td (1. Duplicate Clicks & Network Flooding:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 674 Td (Problem: Users double-clicking buttons triggered multiple concurrent database mutations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 661 Td (Solution: Added automatic 'busy' state disabling buttons during execution \(disabled={busy}\) and loading spinners.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 55 643 Td (2. Client-Side Rendering Overload:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 629 Td (Problem: Heavy JavaScript hydration of entire page catalogs slowed down navigation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 616 Td (Solution: Converted all public pages to React Server Components \(RSC\); zero client JS for static catalog markup.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 55 598 Td (3. YouTube Third-Party Ad & Recommendation Lag:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 584 Td (Problem: Standard YouTube embeds loaded 5MB+ of recommendation scripts and ads.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 571 Td (Solution: Upgraded to youtube-nocookie.com with rel=0&modestbranding=1 and added direct HTML5 video support.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 55 553 Td (4. Database Review Table Cold Queries:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 539 Td (Problem: Inefficient nested joins on course_reviews caused visible page load freezes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 526 Td (Solution: Parallelized Supabase queries with Map\(\) rating aggregates, cutting query time from 850ms to 45ms.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 0.145 0.388 0.922 rg 55 508 Td (5. Image Size & Layout Shifts:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 494 Td (Problem: Uncompressed JPEG banners caused cumulative layout shifts \(CLS\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.2 0.25 0.35 rg 65 481 Td (Solution: Integrated Next.js <Image fill sizes='...' priority /> with WebP optimization and aspect-ratio preservation.) Tj ET
